cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use XVPN in academic work, please cite it as below.
title: XVPN
abstract: >-
  A split-tunnel VPN client that takes a user-supplied WireGuard, OpenVPN or
  Hysteria2 profile and applies automatic traffic splitting between China and
  elsewhere, dual-resolver DNS with cross-validation, failure attribution derived
  from core logs, and evidence-based automatic routing correction. Built on
  sing-box for Windows, Linux and Android with a shared Flutter UI.
